The '''Pattern Texture Pack'''<ref>{{Cite|url=https://news.xbox.com/en-us/2015/03/24/games-minecraft-pattern-texture-pack/|title=The World of Minecraft Just Got Brighter with the Pattern Texture Pack for Xbox|author=Xbox Wire Staff|date=March 24, 2015|website=Xbox Wire}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150430022042/http://www.microsoftstudiosblog.com/mcpattern/|title=Pattern Texture Pack now available for Minecraft on Xbox|date=March 26, 2015|author=[[HelenAngel]]|website=Microsoft Studios Blog}}</ref> is a [[texture pack (downloadable content)|texture pack]] that customizes the game with stylized textures featuring bright and colorful patterns that are reminiscent of textiles.

